  "description": "Every Sunday, Hongju and Cheong get together to play board games.\nThat day, Hongju showed up with a brand new game in hand.\n“Ooh, this looks fun. Easy games are always the most fun.”\nThe two of them started playing, buzzing with excitement.\n“…It says to suck your finger like a lollipop?”\nBut then… things started to get weird.\n[Massage the other person’s bum five times]\n[Suck the finger of the person in front of you like a lollipop]\nThat’s when Hongju finally realised—\nthe Octopus Game she brought… was actually an R-rated board game.\nShe tried to stop the game, but—\n“So you’re backing out? That means you’re the one breaking the pact, yeah?”\n“Who said I’m backing out? It’s just sucking a finger, not a big deal.”\nFalling right into Cheong’s provocation, Hongju decided to keep going.\n“Read the final mission out loud yourself.”\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12742057), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1561015345), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/octopus_game), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000071406), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=250507)",
